✅ 6. Synchronized Method vs Synchronized Block

| Feature                     | Synchronized Method    | Synchronized Block      |
| --------------------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------- |
| Locks Entire Method         | ✅ Yes                 | ❌ No                   |
| Locks Only Critical Section | ❌ No                  | ✅ Yes                  |
| Performance                 | Lower under contention | Better under contention |
| Flexibility                 | Less                   | More                    |